{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04ACE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=　怪 物 之 岛　,ISLA DEL MONSTRUO>上，听说除了Trenya以外，还有其他会说话的猫。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　怪 物 之 岛　,ISLA DEL MONSTRUO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":106,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"还有别的！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯。听说它们叫艾露猫。不过艾露猫好像不会跑到哥斯达黎加来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"要是见到艾露猫，不妨跟它们说说话？也许会有好事发生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"也是……凡事都是经验……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"还有，艾露猫不会伤害人类，都是好家伙，所以可别攻击它们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"嗯。我可没有攻击毫无抵抗的猫的爱好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""}]}